Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; ENABLE PageHeap for python.exe — catches ANY out-of-bounds write
; (Python heap, CRT heap, extension DLL internal buffers) at the exact
; moment it happens. The crashing module will be named in Windows Event
; Log (Application, Event ID 1000).
; NOTE: python.exe will run SLOWER and use MORE RAM while this is enabled.
; Run disable_pageheap.reg to remove.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows NT\CurrentVersion\Image File Execution Options\python.exe]
"GlobalFlag"=dword:20000000
"PageHeapFlags"=dword:00000003
